[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9727.19, "timestamp": "02:42:07", "text": "我确实还有那些旧东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9729.99, "timestamp": "02:42:09", "text": "希望你还能保留那些旧东西。我的意思是，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9732.07, "timestamp": "02:42:12", "text": "你有吗？就像你一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9734.87, "timestamp": "02:42:14", "text": "用的是旧账号，对吧？不，这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9737.19, "timestamp": "02:42:17", "text": "这是新账号，因为我买了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9741.75, "timestamp": "02:42:21", "text": "微软现在也算一个了。我懂了。是的，我想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9747.03, "timestamp": "02:42:27", "text": "第一版将具备此功能。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9754.469, "timestamp": "02:42:34", "text": "好的。好的。这里有一匹骷髅马。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9756.389, "timestamp": "02:42:36", "text": "哦，是的。是的。你还记得吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9758.79, "timestamp": "02:42:38", "text": "暴风雨来了，到处都是洞"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9762.23, "timestamp": "02:42:42", "text": "来了吗？好像有六个人。我的天哪。那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9765.67, "timestamp": "02:42:45", "text": "当时大约六岁。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9769.19, "timestamp": "02:42:49", "text": "是的。而这栋房子，它的主人是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9770.87, "timestamp": "02:42:50", "text": "再次？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9773.27, "timestamp": "02:42:53", "text": "呃，Hikaris。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9777.429, "timestamp": "02:42:57", "text": "Hikaran就在那里。让我们来看看。我得去"}]